entries[152160] = { ["name"] = "Vest of the Dashing Scoundrel", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n8 Armor\n+5 [Agility or Intellect]\n+7 Stamina\n+ 4 Versatility\n+ 6 Mastery\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Rogue\nRegalia of the Dashing Scoundrel (0/6)\nVest of the Dashing Scoundrel\nCloak of the Dashing Scoundrel\nGloves of the Dashing Scoundrel\nCavalier Hat of the Dashing Scoundrel\nPants of the Dashing Scoundrel\nShoulderpads of the Dashing Scoundrel\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Assassination: When you use Envenom, your Deadly and Wound poisons have 35% increased chance to critically strike for 6 sec.\n(2) Set Outlaw: Extra attacks from Saber Slash increase the damage of your next Run Through by 15%, stacking up to 4 times.\n(2) Set Subtlety: Each Combo Point spent reduces the cooldown of Symbols of Death by 0.2 sec.\n(4) Set Assassination: When your Deadly or Wound poisons critically strike the target, you have a 100% chance to gain 3 Energy.\n(4) Set Outlaw: Run Through has a 16% chance to grant you a Roll the Bones combat enhancement buff you do not already have for 10 sec.\n(4) Set Subtlety: [ Gloomblade / Backstab] and Shadowstrike have a 4% chance to grant you Shadow Gestures, causing your next finishing move to refund 100% of Combo Points spent when used. (Proc chance: 4%)\nSell Price:" }
