entries[152172] = { ["name"] = "Grim Inquisitor's Cloak", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nBack\n3 Armor\n+3 [Agility or Strength or Intellect]\n+4 Stamina\n+ 3 Critical Strike\n+ 3 Haste\nClasses: Warlock\nGrim Inquisitor's Regalia (0/6)\nGrim Inquisitor's Cloak\nGrim Inquisitor's Gloves\nGrim Inquisitor's Death Mask\nGrim Inquisitor's Leggings\nGrim Inquisitor's Robes\nGrim Inquisitor's Shoulderguards\nLegacy Set: Bonus is inactive\n(2) Set Affliction: When Agony deals damage, there is a 8% chance to increase the duration of Unstable Affliction on the target by 2.0 sec. (Proc chance: 8%)\n(2) Set Demonology: Each Soul Shard spent on Hand of Gul'dan increases the damage dealt by your next Call Dreadstalkers by 4%.\n(2) Set Destruction: Chaos Bolt increases the critical strike chance of Incinerate on the target by 40% for 8 sec.\n(4) Set Affliction: When you cast Unstable Affliction or Seed of Corruption, all targets within 60 yards suffering from your Agony take 15% increased damage from your Corruption [ Siphon Life : Siphon Life ] and Agony for 8 sec.\n(4) Set Demonology: Increases damage dealt by Hand of Gul'dan by 10%.\n(4) Set Destruction: Chaos Bolt will deal an additional 12% of its direct damage caused to the target over 4 sec.\nSell Price:" }
